WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Step 1: Sign in to admin.google.com as a super admin. Open Security, Access and data control, API controls, then Manage Domain Wide Delegation.

2
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Step 2: Click Add new.

3
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Step 3: Paste the Client ID from your centre card.

4
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Step 4: Paste the scopes from your card exactly. They cover domains, users and site verification only: the agent can't read email.

5
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Step 5: Click Authorize. Google usually applies it in minutes, sometimes up to 24 hours.

6
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Step 6: Your card shows the Client ID and the scopes to paste.

7
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:53.000
Step 7: Add the proof value as a TXT record on your main domain. If that domain is in your Cloudflare, the agent adds it.

8
00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:59.000
Step 8: Paste your super-admin email and connect.
